# Scoped to the synthetic-data blueprint.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Large generated datasets — keep the outputs/ folder + its README, ignore bulky artifacts.
# Commit small sample outputs deliberately with `git add -f` if you want them tracked.
# Flat single-file outputs:
outputs/*.csv
outputs/*.tsv
outputs/*.parquet
outputs/*.json
outputs/*.ndjson
outputs/*.xlsx
outputs/*.sql
# Multi-table run folders: COMMIT latest/ (the stable path models import from - datasets
# must be available on a fresh clone), ignore runs/ snapshots and partials.
outputs/*/runs/
outputs/*/*.partial.json
# grand-exchange: legacy bespoke job with 600MB of fact CSVs - far over GitHub's 100MB file cap.
# Regenerate locally: python projects/grand-exchange/generate.py
outputs/grand-exchange/
!outputs/README.md
